{{define "content"}}
<section class="initialization-page">
<h1>初始化单机</h1>
{{if .InitializationError}}<div class="operation-refusal"><p>{{.InitializationError.Lead}}{{if .InitializationError.Command}} <code>{{.InitializationError.Command}}</code>{{end}}{{.InitializationError.Tail}}</p></div>{{end}}
<div class="operation-result">
<p>将创建本机 vault，并生成一个随机主密钥文件用于加密 vault。</p>
<form method="post" action="/ui/init/standalone/create">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{.CSRFToken}}">
<button type="submit">创建 vault</button>
</form>
</div>
</section>
{{end}}
